sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as WP Admin UI
    participant Plugin as Context Alt Text (WP)
    participant Media as Media Library
    participant Recognition as Recognition API

    Admin->>Plugin: Add new roster entry
    Plugin->>Media: Upload reference image
    Media-->>Plugin: Attachment ID + URL
    Plugin->>Recognition: POST /api/v0/embeddings (image URL)
    Recognition-->>Plugin: EmbeddingsResponse
    Plugin->>Recognition: POST /api/v0/roster (label, type, embeddings)
    Recognition-->>Plugin: { remote_id }
    Plugin->>Media: Store remote_id + avatarId metadata
    Plugin-->>Admin: Show roster entry as SYNCED
